<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"><div style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:left">These amounts represent the aggregate grant date fair value for RSU awards computed in accordance with ASC 718. A discussion of the assumptions used in determining grant date fair value may be found in Note 8 to our consolidated financial statements, included in our Annual Report on Form <div style="white-space:nowrap;display:inline;">10-K</div> for the fiscal year ended December&#160;31, 2025, filed with the SEC on March&#160;26, 2026. </div></td></tr></table>
