<td style="width:4%;vertical-align:top;text-align:left">(7)</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"><div style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:left">Average &#8220;compensation actually paid&#8221; for the <div style="white-space:nowrap;display:inline;">non-PEO</div> NEOs has been calculated in accordance with Item 402(v)(2) of Regulation <div style="white-space:nowrap;display:inline;">S-K.</div> The following adjustments were made to average Summary Compensation Table total compensation for each year to determine average &#8220;compensation actually paid.&#8221; </div></td></tr></table><div style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&#160;</div><div style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:center"><ix:exclude>34</ix:exclude> </div></ix:nonNumeric></ix:continuation></div></div><ix:continuation id="TextSelection_164109514" continuedAt="TextSelectionAppend_164109514_1"><ix:continuation id="TextSelectionAppend_164109507_4" continuedAt="TextSelectionAppend_164109507_5"><ix:exclude><div style="margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:0em; page-break-before:always"></div></ix:exclude></ix:continuation><ix:continuation id="TextSelectionAppend_164109507_5" continuedAt="TextSelectionAppend_164109507_6"><ix:exclude><hr style="color:#999999;height:3px;width:100%;clear:both"/></ix:exclude></ix:continuation><ix:continuation id="TextSelectionAppend_164109507_6" continuedAt="TextSelectionAppend_164109507_7"><ix:exclude><div style="font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold; margin-top: 1.67em; margin-bottom: 1.67em;"><a href="#toc">Table of Contents</a></div></ix:exclude></ix:continuation></ix:continuation><div style="text-align:center"><div style="width:8.5in;text-align:left;margin-left: auto;margin-right: auto"><ix:continuation id="TextSelectionAppend_164109507_7"><ix:continuation id="TextSelectionAppend_164109514_1">
