available for grant under our 2019 Inducement Plan and shares available for grant under the Current Plan for future awards that we may make between April&#160;1, 2026 and the date of the Annual Meeting. </p> <p style="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
